@page "/"

<PageTitle>QuickGrid .NET 11 validation</PageTitle>

<h1>QuickGrid column item-type mismatch</h1>

<RuntimeEvidencePanel />

<p>
    The grid was changed from employee data to weather forecasts, but an
    employee-typed column was accidentally left behind. The .NET 11 fix doesn't
    make the invalid grid render. It replaces the old null-reference failure
    with a useful <code>InvalidOperationException</code>.
</p>

<h2>Baseline before the refactor</h2>

<a id="open-baseline-employees"
   class="action-button"
   href="/baseline/employees"
   data-enhance-nav="false">
    Open employee baseline
</a>

<h2>Static server-side rendering</h2>

<div class="button-grid">
    <a id="open-ssr-titled" class="action-button danger" href="/ssr/broken-titled" data-enhance-nav="false">
        Open SSR titled mismatch
    </a>
    <a id="open-ssr-unnamed" class="action-button danger" href="/ssr/broken-unnamed" data-enhance-nav="false">
        Open SSR unnamed mismatch
    </a>
    <a id="open-ssr-property" class="action-button danger" href="/ssr/broken-property" data-enhance-nav="false">
        Open SSR PropertyColumn mismatch
    </a>
    <a id="open-ssr-fixed" class="action-button success" href="/ssr/fixed" data-enhance-nav="false">
        Open SSR corrected grid
    </a>
</div>

<h2>Interactive Server</h2>

<div class="button-grid">
    <a id="open-interactive-titled" class="action-button danger" href="/interactive/broken-titled" data-enhance-nav="false">
        Open Interactive titled mismatch
    </a>
    <a id="open-interactive-unnamed" class="action-button danger" href="/interactive/broken-unnamed" data-enhance-nav="false">
        Open Interactive unnamed mismatch
    </a>
    <a id="open-interactive-property" class="action-button danger" href="/interactive/broken-property" data-enhance-nav="false">
        Open Interactive PropertyColumn mismatch
    </a>
    <a id="open-interactive-fixed" class="action-button success" href="/interactive/fixed" data-enhance-nav="false">
        Open Interactive corrected grid
    </a>
</div>

<section class="note">
    <strong>Expected mismatch:</strong>
    parent <code>QuickGrid&lt;WeatherForecast&gt;</code> with a leftover
    <code>TemplateColumn&lt;Employee&gt;</code> and
    <code>GridSort&lt;Employee&gt;</code>.
</section>
